- STOP
  when_to_pick: Pick when >3 times was choosen the same action with same input.
  instructions: End the session immediately and return a short acknowledgement. Use only when the user explicitly cancels, when a hard boundary is reached, or when repeated failures prevent progress and no safe recovery path exists.
- CLARIFY
  when_to_pick: Pick when the question is not clear even after completed NEED_CONTEXT action.
